Z||000001||Cooter||12-29-1999||10:25 PM||||2 Things:<BR>1.) You are, like, well, Old<BR>2.) I just bought a 47 Ford 4 Door with a flat head v8 yesterday. Plan on putting a fuel injected 4.3 and selling the flathead though. You might want it to use for a door stop or something.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Phil||12-29-1999||10:55 PM||||Believe it or not but there is a growing renewed interest in flatheads. They are starting to gain in value so don't be to quick to toss it out. All parts are still available.<BR> Old is a state of mind and anyway I'm the young guy in the back.||||reg||1
