Z||000023||batboy||12-31-1999||09:36 AM||||I don't know about the Fords, but there were a few rare 1942 Chevys made before the GM factories completely switched over to war production. Phil, when I guessed your old car as being a deuce, I was looking at the '32 grill. Impressive hotrod! I suppose it's long gone, I'd like to see a more recent pic of the beast.||||reg||1
